{
  "Combat.Spell.Arouse.Damage": " (+{0} lust)"
  "Combat.Spell.Arouse.Description": "The arouse spell draws on your own inner lust in order to enflame the enemy's passions."
  "Combat.Spell.Arouse.Glazed": " Their eyes glaze over with desire for a moment."
  "Combat.Spell.Arouse.Name": "Arouse"
  "Combat.Spell.Arouse.NoEffect": " It has no effect! Your foe clearly does not experience lust in the same way as you."
  "Combat.Spell.Arouse.Squirms": " Your foe squirms as the magic affects them."
  "Combat.Spell.Arouse.Staggers": " Your foe staggers, suddenly weak and having trouble focusing on staying upright."
  "Combat.Spell.Arouse.Text": "You make a series of arcane gestures, drawing on your own lust to inflict it upon your foe!"
  "Combat.Spell.Blind.Blinked": " Your foe blinked!"
  "Combat.Spell.Blind.Description": "Blind is a fairly self-explanatory spell. It will create a bright flash just in front of the victim's eyes, blinding them for a time. However, it will be wasted if they blink."
  "Combat.Spell.Blind.Name": "Blind"
  "Combat.Spell.Blind.Success": " Your foe is blinded!"
  "Combat.Spell.Blind.Text": "You glare at your opponent and point at them. A bright flash erupts before them!"
  "Combat.Spell.ChargeWeapon.Description": "The Charge Weapon spell will surround your weapon in electrical energy, causing it to deal extra damage. The effect lasts for the entire combat."
  "Combat.Spell.ChargeWeapon.Disabled": "Charge weapon is already active and cannot be cast again."
  "Combat.Spell.ChargeWeapon.Name": "Charge Weapon"
  "Combat.Spell.ChargeWeapon.Text": "You utter words of power, summoning an electrical charge around your weapon. It crackles loudly, ensuring you'll do more damage with it for the rest of the fight."
  "Combat.Spell.DivineWind.Description": "Summon and enchant the wind around the battlefield with pure energies, granting a 33% chance to heal you each round for four rounds."
  "Combat.Spell.DivineWind.Name": "Divine Wind"
  "Combat.Spell.DivineWind.Text": "You hold your weapon close to your chest and close your eyes, focusing arcane energies into the air around you. A gentle, golden wind begins to blow, carrying with it the scent of healing herbs."
  "Combat.Spell.Heal.Backfire": " An errant sexual thought crosses your mind, and you lose control of the spell! Your body flushes with unwanted desire as your libido spins out of control."
  "Combat.Spell.Heal.Description": "Heal will attempt to use black magic to close your wounds and restore your body, however like all black magic used on yourself, it has a chance of backfiring and greatly arousing you."
  "Combat.Spell.Heal.Healed": " You flush with success as your wounds begin to knit. (+{0} HP)"
  "Combat.Spell.Heal.Name": "Heal"
  "Combat.Spell.Heal.Text": "You focus on your body and its desire to end pain, trying to draw on your arousal without enhancing it."
  "Combat.Spell.Leech.Description": "Enchant your weapon to drain a portion of your damage as health for the next 3 physical attacks."
  "Combat.Spell.Leech.Disabled": "Your weapon is already enchanted."
  "Combat.Spell.Leech.Name": "Leech"
  "Combat.Spell.Leech.Text": "You whisper a series of arcane incantations while hovering one hand over your weapon. It glows with a faint green light, signaling that your spell worked."
  "Combat.Spell.Might.Backfire": " An errant sexual thought crosses your mind, and you lose control of the spell! Your body flushes with unwanted desire as your libido spins out of control."
  "Combat.Spell.Might.Description": "The Might spell draws upon your lust and uses it to fuel a temporary increase in muscle size and power, raising Strength and Toughness. It does carry the risk of backfiring and raising lust, like all black magic used on oneself."
  "Combat.Spell.Might.Disabled": "Might is already active and cannot be cast again."
  "Combat.Spell.Might.Name": "Might"
  "Combat.Spell.Might.Success": " The rush of success and power flows through your body. You feel like you can do anything! (+{0} Strength and Toughness)"
  "Combat.Spell.Might.Text": "You flush, drawing on your body's desires to empower your muscles and toughen you up."
  "Combat.Spell.Soulburst.Burst": "[pg]Suddenly, you open them, and burst with pure magical force!"
  "Combat.Spell.Soulburst.Description": "Let your soul burn through, massively enhancing your spell power, but halving your health and reducing your defenses. Each casting stacks."
  "Combat.Spell.Soulburst.Name": "Soulburst"
  "Combat.Spell.Soulburst.Text": "You close your eyes and focus, tapping into the power hidden deep within yourself. Unparalleled energy courses through your veins, and you feel your soul straining against its mortal shell."
  "Combat.Spell.SummonScimitar.Alive": "[pg-]After finishing the tip and the pommel, the scimitar comes to life, levitating from your hands and ready to strike."
  "Combat.Spell.SummonScimitar.Description": "Summon a living sword to aid you in combat. It will attack a random target for physical damage each round. You can maintain up to three."
  "Combat.Spell.SummonScimitar.Misses": "[pg-]Your summoned sword streaks towards {0}, but the blow is evaded!"
  "Combat.Spell.SummonScimitar.Name": "Circe's Summoned Scimitars"
  "Combat.Spell.SummonScimitar.Slash": "[pg-]Your summoned sword is enveloped in blue energy as it flies towards {0} and slashes deep!"
  "Combat.Spell.SummonScimitar.Text": "You hold your hands together and focus your magic on them. They crackle with energy as you shape a blade from pure arcane force."
  "Combat.Spell.SummonScimitar.TooMany": "You cannot focus on controlling any more scimitars."
  "Combat.Spell.TKBlast.Damage": " ({0} damage)"
  "Combat.Spell.TKBlast.Description": "Unleash a telekinetic wave against your opponent. Deals physical damage, and may cause the target to flinch this turn."
  "Combat.Spell.TKBlast.Name": "TK. Blast"
  "Combat.Spell.TKBlast.Stun": " Your telekinetic blast proves too strong for your foe, leaving it staggered!"
  "Combat.Spell.TKBlast.Text": "You raise your hand, as if grasping some invisible orb. After a few moments, you swing your arm in a wide arc, unleashing a great wave of telekinetic force against your foe!"
  "Combat.Spell.Whitefire.Damage": " ({0} damage)"
  "Combat.Spell.Whitefire.Description": "Whitefire is a potent fire based attack that will burn your foe with flickering white flames, ignoring their physical toughness and most armors."
  "Combat.Spell.Whitefire.Name": "Whitefire"
  "Combat.Spell.Whitefire.Text": "You narrow your eyes, focusing your mind with deadly intent. You snap your fingers and your foe is enveloped in a flash of white flames!"
  "Combat.Spell.Wither.Description": "Cast a profane spell on your target, and cause any future healing to deal partial damage instead. Requires a black magic focus."
  "Combat.Spell.Wither.Hits": "[pg]The spell hits your [themonster], and [monster.he] fails to resist! The profane hex courses through [monster.him], leaving [monster.him] withered and unable to benefit from healing!"
  "Combat.Spell.Wither.Name": "Wither"
  "Combat.Spell.Wither.Resists": "[pg]The spell hits [themonster], but [monster.he] manages to conjure enough spiritual fortitude to shrug off the profane hex."
  "Combat.Spell.Wither.Text": "You raise a fist to your mouth and focus your mind, channeling healing energies within it. Your hand glows with clear, pure magic, but you whisper profane incantations into it, warping the spell completely! Your hand glows with a purple and black aura as you launch the spell against [themonster]!"
}
